+
+    /* The format the stream is OPENED with is what fixes the isochronous geometry:
+     * uvc_host_stream_open() probes the camera, learns dwMaxPayloadTransferSize and picks
+     * the alternate setting that matches it, then allocates the ISOC URBs from that
+     * endpoint. uvc_host_stream_format_select() below re-commits the format but revisits
